    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>理智值</>\n在非凡世界中行动时，各类事件将使玩家的理智值发生波动。当理智值持续降低，异常状态将从肉体开始，逐步向以太体、心智体、星灵体、精神体蔓延侵蚀，角色将依次进入不同程度的精神状态，并产生对应的效果。 \n\n理智值充足时，角色处于<Highlight>「心智锚定」</>状态，体力消耗下降且减伤提升；降至正常水平则进入<Highlight>「清醒」</>状态，该状态没有任何效果。\n\n随着理智值进一步下降，角色依次进入<Highlight>「心神不宁」「自我存疑」「低语缠身」</>状态，体力与冲刺稳定性受到不同程度的削弱，周遭将出现呓语干扰。\n\n当理智值降至较低区间，角色进入<Highlight>「陷入疯狂」</>状态，行动限制完全解除，伤害与受到伤害均有所提升。\n\n理智值跌至最低时，角色进入<Highlight>「失控边缘」</>状态，<Highlight>伤害提升</>，但受到伤害同步增加，且受到的治疗效果降低，自身发出红光，视野变得疯狂。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>恢复理智</>\n当理智值降至一定程度时，玩家可向安魂诗社成员寻求帮助以恢复理智值。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>失控</>\n若角色长时间处于「失控」状态而未得到净化，五体的侵蚀将持续加深，届时可能引发难以预料的严重后果。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Рассудок</>\nWhen acting in the Extraordinary World, various events will cause the player's Рассудок to fluctuate. As Рассудок continues to decrease, abnormal states will begin from the physical body and gradually erode the Ether Body, Mental Body, Astral Body, and Духовное тело. The character will enter different levels of mental states in Последовательность, producing corresponding effects. \n\nWhen Рассудок is sufficient, the character is in the <Highlight>\"Mental Anchor\"</> state, with reduced stamina consumption and increased Снижение урона; when it drops to a normal level, the character enters the <Highlight>\"Sober\"</> state, which has no effects. \n\nAs Рассудок decreases further, the character enters the <Highlight>\"Restlessness,\" \"Self-Doubt,\" and \"Whispers Haunting\"</> states in Последовательность. Stamina and sprint stability will be weakened to varying degrees, and whispers will appear to interfere with the surroundings. \n\nWhen Рассудок drops to a low range, the character enters the <Highlight>\"Falling into Безумие\"</> state; movement restrictions are completely lifted, and both damage dealt and damage received are increased. \n\nWhen Рассудок drops to the minimum, the character enters the <Highlight>\"Edge of Loss of Control\"</> state, <Highlight>Damage Increase</>, but damage received also increases, and healing effects received are reduced. The character emits a red glow, and their vision becomes frenzied. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Restore Рассудок</>\nWhen Рассудок drops to a certain level, players can seek help from members of the Requiem Poetry Society to restore Рассудок. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Loss of Control</>\nIf a character remains in a \"loss of control\" state for a long time without being purified, the erosion of the five bodies will continue to deepen, which may lead to unpredictable and serious conПоследовательностьs.",
